# Provenance stamps. Written at the moment each input is CONSUMED — the silt sha
# when the fleet binary is built, the harness sha and digest when grading starts —
# so the report names what actually produced the sheet rather than whatever HEAD
# happens to be an hour later. Run artifacts like everything above.
.run-silt-sha
.run-harness-sha
.run-harness-digest
